{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-title='ACL'>\r\n\t\t\tACL\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"icacls grants Full control; CACLS is deprecated; ICACLS does not set or read the owner.","label":"ACL","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/mirror_acl_registry","label":"Mirror ACL","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/mirror_acl_registry"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSee [take ownership of a file, folder, drive, or registry key](http:\/\/www.eightforums.com\/tutorials\/2808-take-ownership-file-folder-drive-registry-key-windows-8-a.html).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>CACLS<\/code> is deprecated in favour of <code class='inline'>ICACLS<\/code>. <code class='inline'>ICACLS<\/code> does not set or read the owner.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Grant<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>icacls &lt;Directory|File&gt; \/grant Administrators:F<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>\/T<\/code> applies the grant to all matching files and subdirectories.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: <code class='inline'>icacls \/grant<\/code> changes NTFS permissions and typically needs elevation.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/acl\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/acl\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/mirror_acl_registry' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/mirror_acl_registry' data-title='Mirror ACL' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Mirror ACL<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-title='ACL'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>ACL<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}